msgstr "@beat 时间"

#: beatstamp/ui/widgets.py:976
msgid ""
"@beat time: the day split into 1000 beats (1 beat = 86.4 s),\n"
"anchored in UTC. @000 is UTC midnight, @500 — UTC noon.\n"
"No time zones: @523 means the same all over the world."
msgstr ""
"@beat 时间：一天分为 1000 个 beat（1 beat = 86.4 秒），\n"
"以 UTC 为基准。@000 是 UTC 午夜，@500 是 UTC 正午。\n"
"没有时区：@523 在全世界都指同一时刻。"

#: beatstamp/ui/main_window.py:273
msgid "@beat timestamps %(version)s — Sigelith Desktop"
msgstr "@beat 时间戳 %(version)s — Sigelith Desktop"

#: beatstamp/ui/dialogs.py:1026
msgid "@beat timestamps for local files"
msgstr "为本地文件加盖 @beat 时间戳"

#: beatstamp/ui/handover_dialogs.py:602
msgid "A .sigelith-answer file."
msgstr "一个 .sigelith-answer 文件。"

#: beatstamp/ui/main_window.py:861
msgid "A .sigelith-handover file someone sent you"
msgstr "别人发给你的 .sigelith-handover 文件"

#: beatstamp/ui/details.py:168
msgid ""
"A Bitcoin block named in the last checkpoint issued BEFORE this entry.\n"
"That checkpoint could not exist before the block was mined,\n"
"and the entry came after the checkpoint."
msgstr ""
"在此条目之前签发的最后一个检查点中所指明的 Bitcoin 区块。\n"
"该区块被挖出之前，这个检查点不可能存在，\n"
"而此条目出现在该检查点之后。"

#: beatstamp/ui/main_window.py:1387
msgid "A SHA-256 digest is exactly <b>64 hexadecimal characters</b> (digits 0-9 and letters a-f).<br><br>%(typed)s were entered."
msgstr "SHA-256 摘要恰好是 <b>64 个十六进制字符</b>（数字 0-9 和字母 a-f）。<br><br>当前输入了 %(typed)s。"

#: beatstamp/ui/main_window.py:2667
