msgstr "包含此条目的检查点已由 Sigelith 无法控制的各方逐字节留存。Sigelith Desktop 亲自比对了这些副本。"

#: beatstamp/ui/handover_dialogs.py:268
msgid "A courtesy only — the recipient identifies you by your card, not by this name."
msgstr "仅为礼貌——接收方凭你的卡片识别你，而不是凭这个名字。"

