#: beatstamp/certificate.py:735
msgid "How to check independently: compute the SHA-256 of your document and enter the result at <b>sigelith.org/proof</b>. The weekly Merkle root is signed with an Ed25519 key and anchored outside Sigelith — in the Bitcoin chain (OpenTimestamps) and by an independent bank confirmation. The certificate attests <i>the existence of the document at a given moment</i> and its integrity — it does not attest authorship or the truth of the content."
msgstr "如何独立核验：计算你的文档的 SHA-256，并在 <b>sigelith.org/proof</b> 输入结果。每周的 Merkle 根由 Ed25519 密钥签名，并锚定在 Sigelith 之外——写入 Bitcoin 区块链（OpenTimestamps），并经独立的银行确认。本证书证实<i>该文档在某一时刻已经存在</i>及其完整性——不证实作者身份或内容的真实性。"

#: beatstamp/ui/handover_report.py:157
msgid "How to check this independently"
msgstr "如何独立检查"

#: beatstamp/ui/handover_dialogs.py:178
msgid "How you made sure that this card belongs to this person. The record is signed with your key and stamped."
msgstr "你如何确认这张卡片属于此人。该记录由你的密钥签名并加盖时间戳。"

#: beatstamp/ui/handover_dialogs.py:64
msgid "I confirm that I have received package %(offer)s from %(sender)s and that I hold its encrypted content. This confirmation takes effect at the moment the key part committed in the offer is recorded in the Sigelith log, provided that happens no later than %(deadline)s. Otherwise it has no effect."
msgstr "我确认已收到 %(sender)s 发来的交付物 %(offer)s，并持有其加密内容。本确认在提议中承诺的密钥部分被记录到 Sigelith 日志的那一刻生效，前提是该记录不晚于 %(deadline)s。否则本确认不产生效力。"

