"Private: Sigelith Desktop keeps a copy of the whole public log and computes\n"
"every proof itself. The server never learns which entries are yours\n"
"— not when statuses are refreshed and not when you check a file.\n"
"\n"
"Fast: Sigelith Desktop asks the server about each digest separately. Less\n"
"data, but the server sees what you ask about.\n"
"\n"
"Stamping always sends the digest — that is its only purpose."
msgstr ""
"隐私：Sigelith Desktop 保存整个公开日志的副本，并自行计算\n"
"每一个证明。服务器永远不会知道哪些条目属于你\n"
"——无论是刷新状态时，还是核验文件时。\n"
"\n"
"快速：Sigelith Desktop 逐个向服务器查询每个摘要。数据量\n"
"更少，但服务器能看到你查询的内容。\n"
"\n"
"盖戳总是会发送摘要——这正是盖戳的唯一用途。"

