#: beatstamp/ui/main_window.py:1571
msgid "The proof needs refreshing — %(name)s"
msgstr "证明需要刷新 — %(name)s"

#: beatstamp/ui/main_window.py:1558
msgid "The proof was checked <b>entirely locally</b> — without connecting to sigelith.org and without trusting anyone. The inclusion path, the root signature, the identity of the key and the week of the stamp all add up. The signature confirms that the document existed no later than the end of the week; the exact moment is given by the register."
msgstr "证明<b>完全在本地</b>完成了核验——未连接 sigelith.org，也无需信任任何人。包含路径、根签名、密钥身份以及戳记所在的周全部吻合。签名证实该文档最迟在该周结束时已经存在；确切时刻由登记簿给出。"

#: beatstamp/ui/main_window.py:2590
msgid "The proxy \"%(proxy)s\" is not a local address. Traffic to the .onion service goes over plain HTTP, so it reaches that machine in clear text — this is NOT anonymisation."
msgstr "代理“%(proxy)s”不是本地地址。发往 .onion 服务的流量走的是普通 HTTP，因此会以明文到达那台机器——这并不是匿名化。"

