#: beatstamp/ui/dialogs.py:1064
msgid "Until version 2.2 this program was called BeatStamp. TimeVaultSecure (timevaultsecure.com) is an earlier product by the same author, and Sigelith Desktop carries over the history it left behind."
msgstr "本程序在 2.2 版之前名为 BeatStamp。TimeVaultSecure（timevaultsecure.com）是同一作者的早期产品，Sigelith Desktop 会接管它留下的历史记录。"

#: beatstamp/ui/dialogs.py:714
msgid ""
"Upper ceiling on the number of entries in the local history. Above\n"
